racts): add experimental local identity revisions\n\nProblem\nLocal project mappings and contribution rationale changes need immutable, bounded records without granting workflow authority.\n\nDecision\nAdd experimental project descriptors, stable FileIds with explicit lineage operations, and content-addressed contribution revisions that bind exact source snapshots and optional brief objects.\n\nRationale\nThe contracts keep local ProjectKey storage separate from logical project identity, preserve uncertainty for inferred renames, and make brief-only changes produce a new revision.\n\nValidation\nRan rustfmt and git diff --check. Cargo and native tests were not run under the active runtime gate.","timestamp":"2026-10-16T00:34:27Z","author":{"name":"Christophe Henner","email":"christophehenner@gmail.com"},"committer":{"name":"Christophe Henner","email":"christophehenner@gmail.com"}},"repository":{"id":1129235824,"node_id":"R_kgDOQ07FcA","name":"Aethyme","full_name":"schiste/Aethyme","private":false,"owner":{"login":"schiste","id":15890754,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODkwNzU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15890754?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste","html_url":"https://github.com/schiste","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/schiste/Aethyme","descripti